      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "I'm wondering if there's a special ruling that applies here that I'm unaware of.  \r\nPlaying in the Temple, Dr. Medico and Idealist became incapacitated.  \r\nI discarded the required number of cards for Rites of Revival.\r\nI then got the message \"7 hero cards have been discarded, but no heros are incapacitated!\" (Not sure of the exact wording, it was quite quick.)\r\n\r\nEach of the Sentinels are certainly a hero character card, and the word \"Incapacitated\" is clearly printed on their back side.\r\nThey're even refered to as \"Incapacitated\" on some of their own cards.\r\n\r\nAny insight?",
